/* The icon registry (ICON-A): ONE line per icon, ICON(ID, FAMILY, "source icon name", PUA code point, "purpose" (a source "custom:<name>" is our own drawing, tools/gen/icons_custom/<name>.svg; the zh-TW names for the sheets are in tools/gen/icon_names_zh.txt)).
 *   ID      UI_ICON_<ID> is a UTF-8 string (icons_gen.h, made by tools/gen/make_icons.py --header) that goes into any text: T() strings, labels, list rows. It draws in the
 *           text colour, at the size of the text around it (the font chain's last file ui-icon.ttf, on the card or in the flash pack), so it is reusable everywhere.
 *   FAMILY  FILLED = Material Symbols Rounded (Apache-2.0), LINE = Tabler Icons (MIT); ONE family per context (the themes-icons design notes "Icons"; tools/check/check_icons.py):
 *           menu ring cells and quick-settings toggles = FILLED; inline text icons (settings/list rows, status line, details, help, messages) = LINE.
 *   source  the glyph name in the pinned upstream font (tools/gen/make_icons.py checks every name exists)
 *   code    a private-use code point U+E000..U+E7FF (never U+F000+: LVGL's own symbols live there); never reused, never renumbered
 * To add an icon: INSERT ONE LINE at the end of its family's block with the next free code point, then `make icons-header`, and `make icons-build` for the font. */
/* ---- FILLED: menu ring cells (home, tools, games, clock, bluetooth, fortune) ---- */
